From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:29:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: goals and today's energy balance reach the AI Coach

- Goals (com.noop.goals): main goal, target weight, daily kcal target and a
  free note, edited in a "Your goals" card in the Coach settings (one hook)
  and stored in noop_prefs. The Food card shows the daily target and what is
  left; the coach gets a GOALS line with the distance to the target weight.
- TODAY line for the coach: steps (resolved like the Today Steps card),
  energy burned (resting + activity via FoodEnergy), eaten and the balance so
  far. FoodEnergy.load now also takes (repo, strapId) for the coach.
- VictorCoachExtras reads the scale snapshot once for BODY and GOALS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
